        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Kick Off World offers the ability to play with national or club teams. The game is not just about playing, coaching is equally important as you head for the Reebok DMX Super League. Kick Off World has four levels, and five modes which includes a practice mode as well as Friendly and Cup Competition modes. As the manager you can sell and buy players.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Kick Off World permite jugar con selecciones nacionales o con equipos de clubes. No se trata solo de jugar: el entrenamiento es igual de importante mientras te diriges a la Reebok DMX Super League. Kick Off World tiene cuatro niveles y cinco modos, entre ellos un modo de práctica y los modos Amistoso y Copa. Como mánager, puedes vender y comprar jugadores.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
